      "description": "Build a Vega-Lite v5 chart spec from backend data only (data inline; nothing estimated). kind: spend_vs_allocation (metric recorded_spend | remaining), projection_vs_allocation (projected | gap; no projection rows when the forecast is unavailable), spend_by_cost_category (recorded_spend | record_count; team may be `unattributed`), budget_history (allocation | envelope_total). Optional team narrows to one team. Title, subtitle and description carry the value kinds and simulated labels; keep them when you show or describe the chart. Read-only: persists nothing.",
      "input_schema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "enum": [
